---
layout: layout.njk
title: Writing
description: Articles, notes, and things worth learning.
permalink: /writing/index.html
---

<section class="notes">
    <p class="eyebrow">THE NOTEBOOK</p>

    <h1>Writing.</h1>

    <p>Notes, ideas, and things I've learned along the way.</p>

    <div class="notes-list">
        {% for article in collections.posts | reverse %}
            <a href="{{ article.url }}" class="note">
                <div class="note-content">
                    <h2>{{ article.data.title }}</h2>

                    {% if article.data.description %}
                        <p>{{ article.data.description }}</p>
                    {% endif %}

                    <span class="note-meta">
                        {{ article.data.category or "ARTICLE" }}
                        {% if article.data.readingTime %}
                            · {{ article.data.readingTime }} MIN READ
                        {% endif %}
                    </span>
                </div>

                <span class="note-arrow">↗</span>
            </a>
        {% else %}
            <p>No articles published yet.</p>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</section>

